You receive four +5 bonuses to place on the stats of your choice, up to a
maximum of 100. A stat already at its maximum does not use a bonus.
After the bonuses you may swap stats. Karma cannot receive bonuses or be swapped.

Select the stat for the bonus by entering the bracketed letter:

   (S)trength            (P)ower        
   (D)exterity           (I)ntelligence 
   (A)gility             (W)isdom       
   (C)onstitution	 C(h)arisma
   (L)uck

